          <h2 class="section-title">DHA Phase 6 Lahore</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="dha-overview-content">
          <div class="dha-overview-main reveal">
            <p>
              <b>DHA Phase 6 Lahore is an expansive 26,000+ kanal planned residential and commercial community managed by the Defence Housing Authority (DHA) Lahore.</b> Initiated in the early 2000s, DHA Phase 6 has grown into Lahore's premier luxury housing destination. Stretched between Bedian Road, Barki Road, and the Lahore Ring Road, covering sectors A through N (excluding sector I), the community features 100% complete urban infrastructure, underground electrification, carpeted multi-lane boulevards, Sui gas, and round-the-clock gated security.
            </p>
            <div class="dha-overview-details glass-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
              <h3>Project Timeline &amp; Details</h3>
              <div class="dha-detail-grid">
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Commencement Date</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">2005</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Location</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">Bounded by Ring Road, Bedian Road &amp; Barki Road, Lahore</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Total Area</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">26,000+ kanals (approx. 3,250+ acres)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Sectors</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">Sector A through Sector N (excluding Sector I) &amp; CCAs</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Grid Station</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">Dedicated underground power distribution grid</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dha-detail-item">
                  <span class="dha-detail-label">Status</span>
                  <span class="dha-detail-value">Fully developed luxury community with ready possession</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dha-overview-block glass-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
              <h3>Key Amenities</h3>
              <ul class="dha-amenity-list">
                <li>
                  <span class="dha-amenity-dot"></span>
                  <div><strong>Parks &amp; Recreation:</strong> DHA Phase 6 features the international 18-hole Defence Raya Golf Club, Central Boulevard parks, and landscaped green belts in every sector.</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="dha-amenity-dot"></span>
                  <div><strong>Commercial Zones:</strong> CCA 1, CCA 2, Main Boulevard Commercial Broadway, upscale retail plazas, and international dining brands serve residents.</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="dha-amenity-dot"></span>
                  <div><strong>Utilities:</strong> 100% underground electric cabling, Sui natural gas, treated municipal water, and wide carpeted signal-free boulevards.</div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="dha-amenity-dot"></span>
                  <div><strong>Security:</strong> DHA Security vigilance patrol force, high-resolution smart CCTV surveillance, and 24/7 dedicated rapid response units.</div>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
