          <span class="section-label">Climate Information</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">DHA Phase 6 Lahore Weather</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="dha-weather-content reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p>
            <b>DHA Phase 6 Lahore experiences a semi-arid climate (Köppen classification: BSh) with 4 distinct seasons: hot summers, monsoon season, a pleasant autumn, and cool winters.</b> The average annual temperature in DHA Phase 6 Lahore ranges from 7°C (44.6°F) in January to 42°C (107.6°F) in June. Annual rainfall averages 628 mm (24.7 inches), with the monsoon season (July to August) contributing the bulk of annual precipitation.
          </p>
          <div class="dha-weather-grid">
            <div class="dha-weather-card glass-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
              <div class="dha-weather-icon">&#9728;&#65039;</div>
              <h3>Summer (April to June)</h3>
              <div class="dha-weather-temp">32°C - 44°C<span class="dha-weather-temp-alt">(89.6°F - 111.2°F)</span></div>
              <p>Hot sunny conditions prevail from April through June, with peak temperatures reaching 44°C in June and average humidity levels around 30-40%.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dha-weather-card glass-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
              <div class="dha-weather-icon">&#127783;&#65039;</div>
              <h3>Monsoon (July to August)</h3>
              <div class="dha-weather-temp">28°C - 38°C<span class="dha-weather-temp-alt">(82.4°F - 100.4°F)</span></div>
              <p>Heavy monsoon showers bring cloud cover and pleasant evening breezes. Monthly rainfall averages 150-200 mm with humidity rising to 65-75%.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dha-weather-card glass-card reveal reveal-delay-4">
              <div class="dha-weather-icon">&#127810;</div>
              <h3>Autumn (September to November)</h3>
              <div class="dha-weather-temp">18°C - 32°C<span class="dha-weather-temp-alt">(64.4°F - 89.6°F)</span></div>
              <p>Pleasant temperatures, lower humidity and clear skies make autumn ideal for outdoor sports, evening walks, and golf at Defence Raya.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dha-weather-card glass-card reveal reveal-delay-5">
              <div class="dha-weather-icon">&#10052;&#65039;</div>
              <h3>Winter (December to February)</h3>
              <div class="dha-weather-temp">7°C - 22°C<span class="dha-weather-temp-alt">(44.6°F - 71.6°F)</span></div>
              <p>Crisp and cool winters bring temperatures between 7°C and 22°C. January is the coolest month with light morning mist and sunny afternoons.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
