          <p>
            <b>The official contact helpline for DHA Lahore is +92-42-111-342-547, and the Phase 6 Property Advisory Desk is reachable at +92-325-7800001.</b> The Defence Housing Authority (DHA) Lahore administration handles property transfers, plot verifications, building control approvals, complaint resolution, and membership services. The main office operates Monday through Friday, from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM (Pakistan Standard Time, UTC+5).
